sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Flask-RESTX API
    participant DB as SQLite Database

    User->>Frontend: Enter username, email and password
    Frontend->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    API->>API: Validate data and check uniqueness
    API->>API: Hash password with Bcrypt
    API->>DB: Create User
    DB-->>API: User saved
    API->>API: Create JWT access token
    API-->>Frontend: 201, token and user
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store session locally
    Frontend-->>User: Redirect to games catalogue
